            remove or supersede local `.planning/plan-approved/2460.md`
            or replace both with an explicit revision-bound approval mechanism
    verify/update `docs/plans/README.md` row `#2460` without re-adding it:
        if local row is already accurate, preserve it as verification-only state
        if stale approval drift is still present, keep the row aligned to the effective non-approved state rather than treating stale approval signals as authoritative
